cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Climate Connectivity Taxonomy, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Climate Connectivity Taxonomy"
abstract: >-
  A SKOS vocabulary of climate-adaptation concepts used to describe resources in
  the weADAPT Connectivity Hub, mirrored as a versioned Turtle file and published
  as a browsable website, with the tooling to build and preview it.
authors:
